## Follow-up Questions
- How would you adapt this for geo-distributed deployments?
- What thresholds would you set for p95/p99 under varied network conditions?

## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical, end-to-end thinking about GPU-backed perf testing, tail latency, and backpressure, not just theory.

## Key Concepts
- GPU utilization, memory pressure, kernel time
- Data transfer, batching, dynamic batching
- Queue depth, backpressure, warmup
- Mixed workloads and tail-latency targets

## Code Example
